{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49021","headline":"腊月中游发生洞裴回之际见双白蝙蝠三飞洞门时多异之同爲口号 · 韦洪","name":"腊月中游发生洞裴回之际见双白蝙蝠三飞洞门时多异之同爲口号","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲验发生洞，先开冰雪行。\n窥临见二翼，色素飞无声。\n状类白蝙蝠，幽感腾化精。\n应知五马来，啓蛰迎春荣。\n露冕□之久，鸣驺还慰情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦洪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49021.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49021","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}